 "words": 196,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "With awesome deeds of righteousness you answer us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "O God of our salvation, the hope of all",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You set the mountains in place by your strength",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Girded with might, you hold the earth in place",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You care for the land and water it",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You enrich it abundantly, yes you do",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The streams of God are filled with water",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To provide the people with grain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You drench its furrows and level its ridges",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You soften it with showers and bless its growth",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You crown the year with your bounty",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your paths overflow with abundance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You care for the land and water it",
